sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User/Browser
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant GL as GitLab API

    U->>FE: Editiert Inhalte + Commit-Text
    FE->>BE: POST /workspaces/commit {repo, branch, basePath, changes[], message, expectedHead}
    BE->>BE: app_token prüfen -> gitlab_access_token
    BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/branches/:branch
    GL-->>BE: { commit: { id: HEAD } }

    alt HEAD != expectedHead (falls mitgeliefert)
        BE-->>FE: 409 Conflict (Branch hat neue Commits)
    else OK
        BE->>BE: changes -> GitLab actions mappen (create/update/delete, file_path, content)
        BE->>GL: POST /projects/:id/repository/commits { branch, commit_message, actions[] }
        GL-->>BE: { id: newCommit, stats, ... }
        BE-->>FE: 200 { commitId: newCommit, head: newCommit, summary: stats }
    end
